   "questionHtml": "<strong>ג1.</strong> המונח: גרף דו-צדדי שלם.<br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> שאלה: חשבו את מספר הצלעות של המשלים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{m,n}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>ג1. הגדרה:</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=K_{m,n}=(A,B,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}A=\\{a_1,\\dots,a_m\\},\\ B=\\{b_1,\\dots,b_n\\}\\\\E=\\{(a_i,b_j):i=1,\\dots,m;\\ j=1,2,\\dots,n\\}\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> פתרון 1: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow class=\"ovl\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{K_{m,n}}=K_m\\cup K_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow class=\"ovl\"><mi>E</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\overline E|=\\frac{m(m-1)}2+\\frac{n(n-1)}2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>פתרון 2: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mrow class=\"ovl\"><mi>E</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\overline E|=\\frac{|V|(|V|-1)}2-|E|=\\frac{(m+n)(m+n-1)}2-m\\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
