   "questionHtml": "<strong>ג1.</strong> (2 נק') האם פונקציית Euler <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span> היא חד-חד-ערכית?<br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> (5 נק') אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\mid\\phi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>ג1.</strong> לא. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ne2</annotation></semantics></math></span> אבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(1)=1=\\phi(2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינה חד-חד-ערכית.<br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\mid n\\Rightarrow n=3^\\alpha\\cdot5^\\beta\\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(m,3)=1=\\gcd(m,5)</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=\\phi(3^\\alpha)\\phi(5^\\beta)\\phi(m)=3^\\alpha\\cdot5^\\beta\\cdot\\left(1-\\frac13\\right)\\left(1-\\frac15\\right)\\phi(m)=2\\cdot4\\cdot3^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot5^{\\beta-1}\\cdot\\phi(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\mid\\phi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "pointsTotal": 7,
