   "questionHtml": "(10 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=14,\\ a_1=27</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n+a_{n-2}=15\\cdot2^n,\\ n\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "* המשוואה האופיינית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>±</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2+1=0\\Rightarrow x_{1,2}=\\pm i\\Rightarrow x_{1,2}=\\cos\\frac\\pi2\\pm i\\sin\\frac\\pi2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>* הפתרון הכללי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n+a_{n-2}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n^{(h)}=C_1\\cos\\frac{n\\pi}2+C_2\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>* פתרון פרטי של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(**)\\ a_n+a_{n-2}=15\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא בצורה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n^{(p)}=A\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. נציב ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(**)</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>:</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\cdot2^n+A\\cdot2^{n-2}=15\\cdot2^n\\ \\Big|\\ :2^{n-2}\\Rightarrow4A+A=15\\cdot4\\Rightarrow A=12\\Rightarrow a_n^{(p)}=12\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>* הפתרון הרקורסיבי הוא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=C_1\\cos\\frac{n\\pi}2+C_2\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}2+12\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=C_1+12=14\\Rightarrow C_1=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_1=C_2+24=27\\Rightarrow C_2=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>לכן: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=2\\cos\\frac{n\\pi}2+3\\sin\\frac{n\\pi}2+12\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
