     "points": 2,
     "html": "פירוק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לראשוניים וכתיבת כל כפולה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> בצורה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><mo>⋯</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1^{\\beta_1}\\cdots p_k^{\\beta_k}\\cdot q</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
