     "promptHtml": "עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=12,\\ m=60</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>∣</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\mid60</annotation></semantics></math></span>. מהו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\phi(60)}{\\phi(12)}</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
     "explainHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(60)=16</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(12)=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וההצגה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot5</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q=5</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(q)=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
