   "questionHtml": "<strong>ב1.</strong> (4 נק') המונח: מחלק של מספר שלם.<br><br><strong>ב2.</strong> (6 נק') שאלה: כמה מחלקים משותפים יש למספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>750</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=750</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=300</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>ב1. הגדרה:</strong> יהיו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k\\in\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le m\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\mid k</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אזי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקרא מחלק של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><strong>ב2.</strong> המחלקים המשותפים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> ושל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> הם המחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(m,n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=2^2\\cdot3\\cdot5^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2\\cdot3\\cdot5^3\\Rightarrow\\gcd(m,n)=2\\cdot3\\cdot5^2=k</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>כל מחלק <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>γ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=2^\\alpha\\cdot3^\\beta\\cdot5^\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span> של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span> מקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta\\in\\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\in\\{0,1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכן מספר המחלקים המשותפים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> ושל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12=2\\cdot2\\cdot3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
