   "solutionHtml": "נסמן ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> את קבוצת כל הפונקציות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f:\\{1,\\dots,5\\}\\to\\{1,\\dots,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i\\in\\{1,\\dots,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(i)\\in\\{1,\\dots,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר 5 אפשרויות, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|=5^5=3125</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>פונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span> עולה (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1)\\le f(2)\\le\\dots\\le f(5)</annotation></semantics></math></span>) <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff</annotation></semantics></math></span> \"<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1),f(2),f(3),f(4),f(5)</annotation></semantics></math></span>\" נקבעת על ידי בחירה של 5 ערכים מתוך 5 עם חזרות. לכן:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>126</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(5,5)=\\binom{5-1+5}{5-1}=\\binom94=\\frac{9\\cdot8\\cdot7\\cdot6}{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot4}=126</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>פונקציות עולות.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3125</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>126</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3125-126=2999</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציות שאינן עולות.",
   "pointsTotal": 7,
   "pitfallsHtml": [
    "לספור פונקציות עולות ממש (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>5</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom55=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>) במקום עולות חלש.",
    "לענות 126, מספר הפונקציות העולות, כשהשאלה מבקשת את אלה שאינן עולות."
   ]
