   "questionHtml": "(8 נק') תהיינה הקבוצות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B=\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. חשבו כמה תתי-קבוצות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span> מכילות רק זוגות <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+b=</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר אי-זוגי.",
   "solutionHtml": "הערה: בניסוח המילולי של השאלה הקבוצה הריקה מכילה רק זוגות מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span> באופן ריק, ולכן הקריאה המילולית נותנת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{15}=32768</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הפתרון הרשמי (והמפתח כאן) מניח שהתת-קבוצה אינה ריקה, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32767</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{15}-1=32767</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>נסמן ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span> את קבוצת הזוגות ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמקיימים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+b=</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר אי-זוגי. אז:<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b)\\in\\Omega\\iff(a,b)\\in\\{1,3,5\\}\\times\\{2,4\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> או <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(a,b)\\in\\{2,4,6\\}\\times\\{1,3,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega=\\{1,3,5\\}\\times\\{2,4\\}\\cup\\{2,4,6\\}\\times\\{1,3,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Omega|=6+9=15</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{15}-1=2^{|\\Omega|}-1=|P(\\Omega)|-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> תתי-קבוצות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span> מכילות רק זוגות מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span> (לא כולל הקבוצה הריקה).<br><br>(הפתרון הרשמי אינו סופר את הקבוצה הריקה.)",
