   "topic": "recurrences",
   "question": "(4+6 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של $a_n$, כאשר $a_0=10,\\ a_1=30$ וגם $a_n=4a_{n-1}-4a_{n-2}$ עבור $n>1$. הראו ש: $a_n=O(n\\bullet3^n)$.",
   "solution": "המשוואה האופיינית היא: $(r-2)^2=0\\iff r^2=4r-4$, $r_1=r_2=2\\Rightarrow a_n=C_1\\cdot2^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot2^n$.\n\n$$\\begin{cases}a_0=10\\\\a_1=30\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}C_1=10\\\\2C_1+2C_2=30\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}C_1=10\\\\C_2=5\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow a_n=10\\cdot2^n+5n\\cdot2^n$$\n\nעבור $n\\ge1$:\n\n$$a_n=10\\cdot2^n+5\\cdot n\\cdot2^n\\le10n\\cdot2^n+5\\cdot n\\cdot2^n=15\\cdot n\\cdot2^n\\le15\\cdot n\\cdot3^n$$\n\n$\\Rightarrow a_n\\le15\\cdot n\\cdot3^n,\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}-\\{0\\}\\Rightarrow a_n=O(n\\cdot3^n)$.",
   "solutionSource": "lecturer-solution",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "points": 10,
   "id": "22B-A-Q2b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "22B-A",
   "examLabel": "אביב 2022, מועד א'",
   "year": 2022,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "נוסחאות נסיגה",
   "questionHtml": "(4+6 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=10,\\ a_1=30</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=4a_{n-1}-4a_{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∙</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=O(n\\bullet3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "המשוואה האופיינית היא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r-2)^2=0\\iff r^2=4r-4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1=r_2=2\\Rightarrow a_n=C_1\\cdot2^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}a_0=10\\\\a_1=30\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}C_1=10\\\\2C_1+2C_2=30\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}C_1=10\\\\C_2=5\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow a_n=10\\cdot2^n+5n\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=10\\cdot2^n+5\\cdot n\\cdot2^n\\le10n\\cdot2^n+5\\cdot n\\cdot2^n=15\\cdot n\\cdot2^n\\le15\\cdot n\\cdot3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow a_n\\le15\\cdot n\\cdot3^n,\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb{N}-\\{0\\}\\Rightarrow a_n=O(n\\cdot3^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
