   "questionHtml": "(4+6 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=5,\\ a_1=36</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=6a_{n-1}-9a_{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=O(n\\cdot5^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "המשוואה האופיינית היא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2=6r-9\\iff(r-3)^2=0\\Rightarrow r_1=r_2=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=C_1\\cdot3^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}a_0=5\\\\a_1=36\\end{cases}\\iff\\begin{cases}C_1=5\\\\3C_1+3C_2=36\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}C_1=5\\\\C_1+C_2=12\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}C_1=5\\\\C_2=7\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>הצורה המפורשת היא: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=5\\cdot3^n+7\\cdot n\\cdot3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n\\le5n\\cdot3^n+7n\\cdot3^n=12\\cdot n\\cdot3^n\\le12n\\cdot5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=O(n\\cdot5^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
