   "solutionHtml": "הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> מעבירה את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,3\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> בצורה חח\"ע ועל: יש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3!</annotation></semantics></math></span> אפשרויות.<br><br>הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> מעבירה את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{4,5,6,7,8\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> על <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{4,5,6\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (על): מספר האפשרויות הוא<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>243</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=3^5-\\binom31\\cdot2^5+\\binom32\\cdot1^5=243-3\\cdot32+3=150</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>מסקנה: יש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">900=6\\cdot150=3!\\cdot150</annotation></semantics></math></span> פונקציות מתאימות.",
