"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר המחלקים האי-זוגיים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "בתרגיל:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk1^k\\cdot3^{n-k}\\right)\\left(\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk3^k\\cdot7^{n-k}\\right)\\cdot3^n=4^n\\cdot10^n\\cdot3^n=2^{3n}\\cdot3^n\\cdot5^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\mid f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> זוגי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>γ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff d=2^\\alpha\\cdot3^\\beta\\cdot5^\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\alpha\\le3n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\beta,\\gamma\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a=3n(n+1)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\mid f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span> אי-זוגי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\iff d=3^\\alpha\\cdot5^\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span> כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\alpha,\\beta\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=(n+1)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=3n(n+1)^4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, פולינום מדרגה 5, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=\\Theta(n^5)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
