   "questionHtml": "(5+4 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=10,\\ a_1=30</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=4a_{n-1}-4a_{n-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "בתרגיל: המשוואה האופיינית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x-2)^2=0\\iff x^2=4x-4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇐</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Leftarrow x_1=x_2=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=C_1\\cdot2^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}a_0=C_1=10\\\\a_1=2C_1+2C_2=30\\end{cases}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\begin{cases}C_1=10\\\\C_2=5\\end{cases}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ a_n=10\\cdot2^n+5n\\cdot2^n,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>"
