   "topicLabel": "פונקציית אוילר",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>ב1.</strong> (5 נק') המונח: הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span> של Euler.<br><br><strong>ב2.</strong> (4 נק') שאלה: הראו שקיים מספר ראשוני יחיד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמקיים התנאי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(p)\\mid p</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>ב1. הגדרה:</strong> הפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span> של Euler היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi:\\mathbb{N}^*\\to\\mathbb{N}^*</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך ש: לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}^*</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=\\left|\\{k:1\\le k\\le n\\wedge\\gcd(n,k)=1\\}\\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><strong>ב2.</strong> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> התנאי מתקיים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(2)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(2)\\mid2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> ראשוני ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(p)=p-1\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∤</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(p)\\nmid p</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(p)\\mid p</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> ראשוני, רק עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
