   "topic": "recurrences",
   "question": "(4+5 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של $a_n$, כאשר $a_0=3,\\ a_1=14$ וגם $a_n=8a_{n-1}-16a_{n-2}+18$ עבור $n>1$.",
   "solution": "המשוואה האופיינית: $x^2-8x+16=0\\ \\Leftarrow\\ x_1=x_2=4$, ולכן $a_n^{(h)}=C_1\\cdot4^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot4^n$.\n\nפתרון פרטי: $a_n^{(p)}=A\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A=8A-16A+18\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A=2$.\n\nאז $a_n=C_1\\cdot4^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot4^n+2$.\n\n$$\\begin{cases}a_0=C_1+2=3\\\\a_1=4C_1+4C_2+2=14\\end{cases}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\begin{cases}C_1=1\\\\C_2=2\\end{cases}$$\n\nולכן $a_n=4^n+2n\\cdot4^n+2,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{N}$.",
   "solutionSource": "lecturer-solution",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "points": 9,
   "id": "23B-B-Q2b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "23B-B",
   "examLabel": "אביב 2023, מועד ב'",
   "year": 2023,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "נוסחאות נסיגה",
   "questionHtml": "(4+5 נק') מצאו את הצורה המפורשת של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_0=3,\\ a_1=14</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=8a_{n-1}-16a_{n-2}+18</annotation></semantics></math></span> עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "המשוואה האופיינית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇐</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2-8x+16=0\\ \\Leftarrow\\ x_1=x_2=4</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n^{(h)}=C_1\\cdot4^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot4^n</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>פתרון פרטי: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n^{(p)}=A\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A=8A-16A+18\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=C_1\\cdot4^n+C_2\\cdot n\\cdot4^n+2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{cases}a_0=C_1+2=3\\\\a_1=4C_1+4C_2+2=14\\end{cases}\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\begin{cases}C_1=1\\\\C_2=2\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_n=4^n+2n\\cdot4^n+2,\\ n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
