   "questionHtml": "(8 נק') מהו מספר התמורות של הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמקיימות <strong>לפחות אחד</strong> מהתנאים הבאים: המספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצאים בסמיכות <strong>או</strong> המספרים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4,5</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצאים בסמיכות?",
   "solutionHtml": "נסמן ב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצת התמורות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שבהן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1,2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצאים בסמיכות, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2</annotation></semantics></math></span> קבוצת התמורות של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שבהן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4,5</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצאים בסמיכות.<br><br>אז נקבל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_1|=|A_2|=4!\\cdot2=48</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_1\\cap A_2|=3!\\cdot2!\\cdot2!=24</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לפי עקרון ההכלה וההדחה נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_1\\cup A_2|=|A_1|+|A_2|-|A_1\\cap A_2|=72</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>מסקנה: התשובה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
