   "year": 2024,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "עצים",
   "questionHtml": "(6 נק') יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> גרף בלתי מכוון וקשיר עם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|=n\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הראו כי: אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא עץ, אז מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum\\{\\deg(v):v\\in V\\}=2n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>. האם קיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> ששונה מעץ כך שעבורו מתקיים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum\\{\\deg(v):v\\in V\\}=2n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span>?",
   "solutionHtml": "אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא עץ, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|=n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> ולכן (לפי משפט הדרגות) נקבל<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum\\{\\deg(v):v\\in V\\}=2|E|=2n-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>לא קיים כי:<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> קשיר וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>←</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum\\{\\deg(v):v\\in V\\}=2n-2\\ \\leftarrow\\ G</annotation></semantics></math></span> קשיר וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|=n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> חייב להיות עץ."
