   "topic": "sum_product_inclusion",
   "question": "**א1.** (8 נק') המונח: עקרון הסכום.\n\n**א2.** שאלה: תהי הקבוצה $A=\\{1,2,3,\\dots,100\\}$. חשבו כמה מספרים מ-$A$ מתחלקים ב-3 או ב-49 או ב-37.",
   "solution": "**א1. הגדרה:** לפי ההרצאה.\n\n**א2.** נסמן ב: $A_1=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge3\\mid n\\}$, ולכן $|A_1|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{3}\\right\\rfloor=33$.\n\n$A_2=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge49\\mid n\\}$, ולכן $|A_2|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{49}\\right\\rfloor=2$.\n\n$A_3=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge37\\mid n\\}$, ולכן $|A_3|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{37}\\right\\rfloor=2$.\n\nאכן: $\\mathrm{lcm}(3,49),\\ \\mathrm{lcm}(3,37),\\ \\mathrm{lcm}(49,37)\\notin A$.\n\nלכן $A_1\\cap A_2=A_1\\cap A_3=A_2\\cap A_3=\\emptyset\\Rightarrow|A_1\\cup A_2\\cup A_3|=|A_1|+|A_2|+|A_3|=37$.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "points": 8,
   "id": "25B-A-Q1a",
   "partKey": "a",
   "examCode": "25B-A",
   "examLabel": "אביב 2025, מועד א'",
   "year": 2025,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "הכלה והדחה",
   "questionHtml": "<strong>א1.</strong> (8 נק') המונח: עקרון הסכום.<br><br><strong>א2.</strong> שאלה: תהי הקבוצה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{1,2,3,\\dots,100\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. חשבו כמה מספרים מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתחלקים ב-3 או ב-49 או ב-37.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>א1. הגדרה:</strong> לפי ההרצאה.<br><br><strong>א2.</strong> נסמן ב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge3\\mid n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_1|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{3}\\right\\rfloor=33</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_2=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge49\\mid n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>49</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_2|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{49}\\right\\rfloor=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∧</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_3=\\{n:n\\in A\\wedge37\\mid n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>37</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A_3|=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{100}{37}\\right\\rfloor=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>אכן: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>49</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>37</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>49</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>37</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{lcm}(3,49),\\ \\mathrm{lcm}(3,37),\\ \\mathrm{lcm}(49,37)\\notin A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_1\\cap A_2=A_1\\cap A_3=A_2\\cap A_3=\\emptyset\\Rightarrow|A_1\\cup A_2\\cup A_3|=|A_1|+|A_2|+|A_3|=37</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
