   "questionHtml": "(11 נק') חשבו את מספר המחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמתחלקים ב-12, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;9</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot2^{n-k}\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot6^k\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot5^k=f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "solutionHtml": "לפי נוסחת הבינום של Newton נקבל:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=(2+1)^n\\cdot(6+1)^n\\cdot(5+1)^n=3^n\\cdot7^n\\cdot6^n=2^n\\cdot3^{2n}\\cdot7^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>γ</mi></msup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>12</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=2^\\alpha\\cdot3^\\beta\\cdot7^\\gamma\\iff\\left(2^2\\cdot3\\mid d\\wedge d\\mid f(n)\\right)\\iff12\\mid d\\wedge d\\mid f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\le\\alpha\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\beta\\le2n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\gamma\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות.<br><br>מסקנה: ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n(n^2-1)=2n(n-1)(n+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> מחלקים שמתחלקים ב-12."
