   "questionHtml": "(5 נק') יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1&lt;n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7^2\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתחלק ב-21.",
   "solutionHtml": "אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7^2\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=7^\\alpha\\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\le\\alpha\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le m\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>gcd</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gcd(7,m)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span>. לכן נקבל ש:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=\\phi(7^\\alpha)\\cdot\\phi(m)=7^\\alpha\\left(1-\\frac17\\right)\\phi(m)=7^{\\alpha-1}\\cdot6\\cdot\\phi(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>מכיוון ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⇐</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\ge2\\Leftarrow\\alpha-1\\ge1</annotation></semantics></math></span> נקבל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(21=)\\,7\\cdot3\\mid\\phi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
