   "question": "(5 נק') אם $T=(V,E)$ הוא עץ בעל 4 צלעות, הראו שהמשלים שלו אינו דו-צדדי.",
   "solution": "מכיוון ש: $T$ עץ, נקבל ש: $|V|=|E|+1=5$.\n\nכמו כן $T=(A,B,E)$ הוא דו-צדדי (כי עץ הוא דו-צדדי) וגם $|V|=|A|+|B|=5$, ולכן $\\max\\{|A|,|B|\\}\\ge3$.\n\nנניח ש: $\\max\\{|A|,|B|\\}=|A|$, אז $|A|\\ge3$, ולכן ב-$\\overline{T}$ יש $C_3$ (על שלושה צמתים מ-$A$), מעגל אי-זוגי.\n\nמסקנה: $\\overline{T}$ אינו דו-צדדי.",
   "solutionSource": "student-solution",
   "official": true,
   "confidence": "high",
   "points": 5,
   "id": "25B-A-Q4b",
   "partKey": "b",
   "examCode": "25B-A",
   "examLabel": "אביב 2025, מועד א'",
   "year": 2025,
   "source": "exam",
   "topicLabel": "גרפים: יסודות",
   "questionHtml": "(5 נק') אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא עץ בעל 4 צלעות, הראו שהמשלים שלו אינו דו-צדדי.",
   "solutionHtml": "מכיוון ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> עץ, נקבל ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|=|E|+1=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>כמו כן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=(A,B,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא דו-צדדי (כי עץ הוא דו-צדדי) וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|=|A|+|B|=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max\\{|A|,|B|\\}\\ge3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>נניח ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max\\{|A|,|B|\\}=|A|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|\\ge3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow class=\"ovl\"><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span> (על שלושה צמתים מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>), מעגל אי-זוגי.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow class=\"ovl\"><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו דו-צדדי."
