   "questionHtml": "(13 נק') יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> גרף לא מכוון בעל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E\\ne\\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math></span>. הוכיחו או הפריכו:<br><br><strong>(ב1)</strong> (4 נק') אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|&gt;|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אזי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא קשיר.<br><br><strong>(ב2)</strong> (4 נק') אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|&lt;|V|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אזי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא לא קשיר.<br><br><strong>(ב3)</strong> (5 נק') אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>odd</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\deg(v)=\\text{odd}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v\\in V</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=(V,U)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא עץ פורש כלשהו של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אזי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|U|</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר אי-זוגי.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>(ב1)</strong> הטענה לא נכונה. דוגמה נגדית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=K_4</annotation></semantics></math></span> יחד עם צומת מבודד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_5</annotation></semantics></math></span> (ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש 6 צלעות ו-5 צמתים, והוא אינו קשיר).<br><br><strong>(ב2)</strong> הטענה לא נכונה. דוגמה נגדית: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_4</annotation></semantics></math></span> (3 צלעות, 4 צמתים, והוא קשיר).<br><br><strong>(ב3)</strong> הטענה נכונה. <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V|=n</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר זוגי (בעזרת משפט הדרגות, כי כל הדרגות אי-זוגיות), ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|U|=|V|-1=n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא אי-זוגי."
