   "questionHtml": "<strong>א1.</strong> (8 נק') המונח: עקרון הכפל.<br><br><strong>א2.</strong> שאלה: יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10!</annotation></semantics></math></span>. חשבו כמה מחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינם מתחלקים ב-7.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>א1. הגדרה:</strong> לפי ההרצאה.<br><br><strong>א2.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10!=1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot2^2\\cdot5\\cdot(2\\cdot3)\\cdot7\\cdot2^3\\cdot3^2\\cdot(2\\cdot5)=2^8\\cdot3^4\\cdot5^2\\cdot7</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>γ</mi></msup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>7</mn><mo>∤</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=2^\\alpha\\cdot3^\\beta\\cdot5^\\gamma\\iff7\\nmid d\\wedge d\\mid n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\in A=\\{0,1,2,\\dots,8\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta\\in B=\\{0,1,2,3,4\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\in C=\\{0,1,2\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לפי עקרון הכפל נקבל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>135</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">135=9\\cdot5\\cdot3=|A|\\cdot|B|\\cdot|C|</annotation></semantics></math></span> מחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> שאינם מתחלקים ב-7."
