   "questionHtml": "<strong>ג1.</strong> (9 נק') המונח: עלה של גרף לא מכוון.<br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> שאלה: יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> עץ בעל 30 צמתים. אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\deg(v)\\in\\{1,5\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v\\in V</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מצאו את מספר העלים שיש ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>ג1. הגדרה:</strong> לפי ההרצאה.<br><br><strong>ג2.</strong> ידוע ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{v\\in V}\\deg(v)=2|E|</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל גרף, וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{v\\in V}\\deg(v)=2(n-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span> לכל עץ בעל <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> צמתים.<br><br>נסמן ב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> = מספר העלים. אז נקבל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p+5(30-p)=2(30-1)\\iff p+150-5p=60-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mn>92</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow92=4p\\Rightarrow p=23</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
