   "questionHtml": "(9 נק') חשבו את מספר המחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמתחלקים ב-15, כאשר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;10</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגם<br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot2^{n-k}\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot8^k\\cdot3^{n-k}\\cdot\\sum_{k=0}^{n}\\binom nk\\cdot4^k=f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>",
   "solutionHtml": "לפי הבינום של Newton נקבל:<br><br><span class=\"math-block\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)=(2+1)^n\\cdot(8+3)^n\\cdot(4+1)^n=3^n\\cdot5^n\\cdot11^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>α</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mi>γ</mi></msup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>15</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=3^\\alpha\\cdot5^\\beta\\cdot11^\\gamma\\iff(3\\cdot5)\\mid d\\wedge d\\mid f(n)\\iff15\\mid d\\wedge d\\mid f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><br>כאשר: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\alpha\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות; <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\le\\beta\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות; וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le\\gamma\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span> אופציות.<br><br>מסקנה: מספר המחלקים של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמתחלקים ב-15 שווה ל: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2(n+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
