   "topicLabel": "פונקציית אוילר",
   "questionHtml": "(5 נק') מצאו כל מספר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\in\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמקיים את התנאים הבאים: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר ראשוני וגם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא מספר ראשוני.",
   "solutionHtml": "אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=1\\ne</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר ראשוני.<br><br>אם <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=2=</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר ראשוני.<br><br>נניח ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר ראשוני ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;3</annotation></semantics></math></span>, אז נקבל:<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(n)=n\\left(1-\\frac1n\\right)=n-1=</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר זוגי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ \\&amp;\\ \\phi(n)&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇐</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\mid\\phi(n)\\ \\&amp;\\ 2\\ne\\phi(n)\\Leftarrow\\phi(n)\\ne</annotation></semantics></math></span> מספר ראשוני.<br><br>מסקנה: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא הפתרון היחיד, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> היחיד שמקיים את התנאים."
