   "questionHtml": "(13 נק') יהי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> גרף לא מכוון, קשיר, כך שב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> יש צומת אחד בדרגה 4 ושאר הצמתים בדרגה 5. הראו ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\le\\chi(G)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
   "solutionHtml": "<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>⇐</mo><mi>χ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E\\ne\\phi\\Leftarrow\\chi(G)\\ge2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>נניח, בשלילה, ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi(G)=2</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(A,B,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span> הוא גרף דו-צדדי.<br><br>נסמן ב: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> את הצומת שדרגתו 4 ונניח, בלי הגבלת הכלליות, ש: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>אז: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mi>deg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{x\\in A}\\deg(x)=\\sum_{y\\in B}\\deg(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span>:<br><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇐</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4+5(|A|-1)=5|B|\\iff5|A|-5|B|=1\\iff5(|A|-|B|)=1\\Leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span> בסתירה, כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A|-|B|</annotation></semantics></math></span> שלם.<br><br>לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> אינו 2-צביע, כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>χ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\chi(G)\\ge3</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
